From 48d6d2f7d6c30d30eac3ca324c2974464474f2ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sebastian Matkovich <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:10:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 152/156] webrender: declare vertex attributes with attribute,
 not in

GLSL ES 1.00 only knows attribute; base.glsl maps it to in for the other
versions, so the shaders compile unchanged there (GL 3: 64, ES 3: 49
variants).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
